msgstr "⟪k:0⟫而且，⟪k:1⟫我没觉得自己有那么好。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫因为我也做错了不少事……"

#: omake:omake_144794EF_6F90_4486_983B_6646972FE572
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bd96ee7b043b7c02c14f54c8c12bff2471d4c9bf6180e5346007205c4e59d122
